  <name>Resonate</name>
  <summary>Podcast downloader and player</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Resonate subscribes to podcast feeds, downloads episodes and plays them, on the Linux desktop.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automatic downloads with per-show rules, a storage limit and removal of played episodes</li>
      <li>Chapters, transcripts, a sleep timer, silence trimming and per-show speed</li>
      <li>Search across Apple Podcasts, gpodder.net, fyyd and Podcast Index</li>
      <li>Subscription and position sync with gpodder.net-compatible servers</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <developer id="io.github.sekhnat"><name>sekhnat</name></developer>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.sekhnat.resonate.desktop</launchable>
